    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> As <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> ...(i)<br />And, also <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></math> ...(ii)<br />Solving (i) &amp; (ii), we get<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />i.e, <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Here <math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ...(i)<br />And <math><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> ...(ii)<br />Solving (i) and (ii),<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Here, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br />Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math><br />Now, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn></math>",
